```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Push/PR] --> B{Change Detection}

    B -->|Code Changes| C[ci.yml<br/>Multi-Platform Build]
    B -->|Docs Only| D[Skip Build]

    C --> E[Build Matrix<br/>{{platforms}}]
    E --> F[Integration Tests]
    F --> G{All Pass?}

    G -->|Yes| H[security.yml<br/>Security Scanning]
